amily: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">James Stagg<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Andrew+Scott-61258\" title=\"Andrew Scott\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Andrew Scott<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">) musi podj\u0105\u0107 najwa\u017cniejsz\u0105 decyzj\u0119 w swojej karierze \u2013 prognoza, kt\u00f3r\u0105 przedstawi, mo\u017ce przes\u0105dzi\u0107 o sukcesie lub kl\u0119sce najwi\u0119kszej operacji wojskowej w historii. Zamkni\u0119ty w atmosferze nieufno\u015bci i presji ze strony najwy\u017cszych dow\u00f3dc\u00f3w, Stagg toczy psychologiczn\u0105 walk\u0119 z czasem, wspierany jedynie przez kapitan <\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Kay+Summersby-393342\" title=\"Kay Summersby\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Kay Summersby<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Kerry+Condon-136125\" title=\"Kerry Condon\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Kerry Condon<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">). Nad wszystkim czuwa genera\u0142 <\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Dwight+D.+Eisenhower-210712\" title=\"Dwight D. Eisenhower\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Dwight D. Eisenhower<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"> (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Brendan+Fraser-5137\" title=\"Brendan Fraser\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Brendan Fraser<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">), kt\u00f3ry musi zdecydowa\u0107 czy ruszy\u0107 z inwazj\u0105, czy j\u0105 op\u00f3\u017ani\u0107 \u2013 ryzykuj\u0105c, \u017ce Niemcy odkryj\u0105 plany aliant\u00f3w.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Pressure","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T2D4374","movieType":"","director":"Anthony Maras","organizer":"","country":"Francja\/ USA\/ Wielka Brytania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2009\/1787223362.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":26,"name":"Kino Wilga 312","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Garwolin","city_id":1656,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"13977":{"id":13977,"title":"TEDI I MAGICZNA LAMPA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tedi-i-magiczna-lampa-2026-10-02-13-55","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2011\/1790070502.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T13:55:00+02:00","availableTickets":294,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 13:10:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 12:55:00"},"products":[{"id":17,"name":"Normalny 2D","rawPrice":2200,"price":"22,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":294}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2011,"name":"TEDI I MAGICZNA LAMPA ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Oli, nieustraszona dwuletnia c\u00f3rka Tadeo, sprawi\u0142a, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 on nadopieku\u0144czym ojcem, a urocza Mumia czuje si\u0119 odsuni\u0119ta na bok. Kiedy w Pa\u0142acu Buckingham znajduj\u0105 magiczn\u0105 lamp\u0119, Mumia prosi j\u0105 o przeniesienie w czasie do Paititi w Peru w 1502 roku. Tad, Sara i ca\u0142a ekipa b\u0119d\u0105 musieli pod\u0105\u017cy\u0107 za Mumi\u0105 w przesz\u0142o\u015b\u0107, zanim co\u015b zmieni bieg historii... Podr\u00f3\u017c zabierze ich przez Ocean Atlantycki z Peru do Grecji, a stamt\u0105d w g\u0142\u0105b Bliskiego Wschodu, a\u017c do jaskini Ali Baby i czterdziestu rozb\u00f3jnik\u00f3w.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Tadeo Jones y la l\u00e1mpara maravillosa","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026D2D4402","movieType":"","director":"Enrique Gato","organizer":"","country":"Hiszpania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2011\/1790070502.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":26,"name":"Kino Wilga 312","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Garwolin","city_id":1656,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"13982":{"id":13982,"title":"LALKA  ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-16-10","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2012\/1790070492.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T16:10:00+02:00","availableTickets":308,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 15:25:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-02 15:10:00"},"products":[{"id":17,"name":"Normalny 2D","rawPrice":2200,"price":"22,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":308}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2012,"name":"LALKA  ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Marcin+Doroci%C5%84ski-42489\" title=\"Marcin Doroci\u0144ski\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Marcin Doroci\u0144ski<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">) ow\u0142adni\u0119te jest szalon\u0105 mi\u0142o\u015bci\u0105 do Izabeli \u0141\u0119ckiej (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Kamila+Urz%C4%99dowska-2638609\" title=\"Kamila Urz\u0119dowska\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Kamila Urz\u0119dowska<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">). On, dzi\u0119ki fortunie zdobytej na wojnie, powraca do kraju i postanawia wkroczy\u0107 do \u015bwiata wy\u017cszych sfer, aby zdoby\u0107 r\u0119k\u0119 ukochanej. Ona jest ol\u015bniewaj\u0105ca i wynios\u0142a, lecz mimo arystokratycznego pochodzenia zmaga si\u0119 z widmem finansowej ruiny. U boku Wokulskiego stoi jego wierny przyjaciel \u2013 Ignacy Rzecki (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Marek+Kondrat-253\" title=\"Marek Kondrat\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Marek Kondrat<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Lalka","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026O2D4432","movieType":"","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2012\/1790070492.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":26,"name":"Kino Wilga 312","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Garwolin","city_id":1656,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"13983":{"id":13983,"title":"LALKA  ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-16-10-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2012\/1790070492.jpg","date":"2026-10-02T19:35:00+02:00","availableTickets":300,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-02 18:50:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:0