n-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Marek Kondrat<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Lalka","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026O2D4432","movieType":"","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2012\/1790070492.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":26,"name":"Kino Wilga 312","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Garwolin","city_id":1656,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"13979":{"id":13979,"title":"TEDI I MAGICZNA LAMPA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tedi-i-magiczna-lampa-2026-10-04-13-55","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2011\/1790070502.jpg","date":"2026-10-04T13:55:00+02:00","availableTickets":311,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-04 13:10:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservat