znych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Lalka","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026O2D4432","movieType":"","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2012\/1790070492.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":26,"name":"Kino Wilga 312","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Garwolin","city_id":1656,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"13981":{"id":13981,"title":"TEDI I MAGICZNA LAMPA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/tedi-i-magiczna-lampa-2026-10-06-13-55","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2011\/1790070502.jpg","date":"2026-10-06T13:55:00+02:00","availableTickets":312,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-06 13:10:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-06 12:55:00"},"products":[{"id":13,"name":"Bilet ","rawPrice":1700,"price":"17,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":312}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2011,"name":"TEDI I MAGICZNA LAMPA ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Oli, nieustraszona dwuletnia c\u00f3rka Tadeo, sprawi\u0142a, \u017ce sta\u0142 si\u0119 on nadopieku\u0144czym ojcem, a urocza Mumia czuje si\u0119 odsuni\u0119ta na bok. Kiedy w Pa\u0142acu Buckingham znajduj\u0105 magiczn\u0105 lamp\u0119, Mumia prosi j\u0105 o przeniesienie w czasie do Paititi w Peru w 1502 roku. Tad, Sara i ca\u0142a ekipa b\u0119d\u0105 musieli pod\u0105\u017cy\u0107 za Mumi\u0105 w przesz\u0142o\u015b\u0107, zanim co\u015b zmieni bieg historii... Podr\u00f3\u017c zabierze ich przez Ocean Atlantycki z Peru do Grecji, a stamt\u0105d w g\u0142\u0105b Bliskiego Wschodu, a\u017c do jaskini Ali Baby i czterdziestu rozb\u00f3jnik\u00f3w.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Tadeo Jones y la l\u00e1mpara maravillosa","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026D2D4402","movieType":"","director":"Enrique Gato","organizer":"","country":"Hiszpania","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2011\/1790070502.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":26,"name":"Kino Wilga 312","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Garwolin","city_id":1656,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"13990":{"id":13990,"title":"LALKA  ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-06-16-10","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2012\/1790070492.jpg","date":"2026-10-06T16:10:00+02:00","availableTickets":312,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-06 15:25:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":false,"endAt":"2026-10-06 15:10:00"},"products":[{"id":13,"name":"Bilet ","rawPrice":1700,"price":"17,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":312}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2012,"name":"LALKA  ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Warszawa ko\u0144ca XIX wieku. Serce Stanis\u0142awa Wokulskiego (<\/span><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https:\/\/www.filmweb.pl\/person\/Marcin+Doroci%C5%84ski-42489\" title=\"Marcin Doroci\u0144ski\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-bl