lock: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); outline: none; color: rgb(151, 97, 3); text-decoration: none; cursor: pointer; transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Marek Kondrat<\/a><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">), romantyk, kt\u00f3ry z nostalgi\u0105 obserwuje, jak \u015bwiat idea\u0142\u00f3w ust\u0119puje miejsca spo\u0142ecznym aspiracjom i bezwzgl\u0119dnej grze interes\u00f3w. Wokulski wkracza w labirynt arystokratycznych salon\u00f3w, gdzie ka\u017cdy gest mo\u017ce by\u0107 pocz\u0105tkiem intrygi, a ka\u017cde s\u0142owo \u2013 zapowiedzi\u0105 zdrady. Staj\u0105cy na jego drodze rywale, niespodziewane sojusze i dramatyczne wybory wystawi\u0105 na pr\u00f3b\u0119 jego marzenia i wiar\u0119 w ludzi. To opowie\u015b\u0107 o mi\u0142osnym zauroczeniu, kt\u00f3re zmienia losy bohater\u00f3w i zaciera granice mi\u0119dzy sercem a rozumem.<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Lalka","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026O2D4432","movieType":"","director":"Maciej Kawalski","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2012\/1790070492.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":26,"name":"Kino Wilga 312","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Garwolin","city_id":1656,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"14030":{"id":14030,"title":"VERITY CORAZ WI\u0118KSZY MROK ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/verity-coraz-wiekszy-mrok-2026-10-16-20-15-1","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2015\/1790070453.jpg","date":"2026-10-17T20:15:00+02:00","availableTickets":312,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-17 19:30:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-17 19:15:00"},"products":[{"id":17,"name":"Normalny 2D","rawPrice":2200,"price":"22,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":312}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2015,"name":"VERITY CORAZ WI\u0118KSZY MROK ","description":"<div><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Lowen Ashleigh przyjmuje zlecenie doko\u0144czenia bestsellerowej serii Verity Crawford, kt\u00f3ra po wypadku nie jest w stanie pisa\u0107. W domu Crawford\u00f3w odkrywa sekrety, kt\u00f3re zmieniaj\u0105 wszystko.<\/span><\/div>","oryginal_title":"Verity","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026T2D4678","movieType":"","director":"Michael Showalter","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2015\/1790070453.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":26,"name":"Kino Wilga 312","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Garwolin","city_id":1656,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"14026":{"id":14026,"title":"PUCIO KOCHA ZWIERZAKI ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/pucio-kocha-zwierzaki-2026-10-18-13-10","image":"\/uploads\/event\/1997\/1784138041.jpg","date":"2026-10-18T13:10:00+02:00","availableTickets":312,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-18 12:25:00","startAt":"2026-07-15 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-18 12:10:00"},"products":[{"id":17,"name":"Normalny 2D","rawPrice":2200,"price":"22,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":312}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":1997,"name":"PUCIO KOCHA ZWIERZAKI ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Tym razem obok rodziny Pucia w wa\u017cnych rolach wyst\u0105pi\u0105 pies Funio, kot Mimi oraz ca\u0142a ferajna zwierzak\u00f3w. Przygotujcie si\u0119 na mn\u00f3stwo \u015bmiechu, wakacyjnych przyg\u00f3d i rodzinnych wzrusze\u0144!<\/span>","oryginal_title":"Pucio kocha zwierzaki","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026O2D4104","movieType":"animowany","director":"Marta Str\u00f3\u017cycka","organizer":"","country":"Polska","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"3","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/1997\/1784138041.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":26,"name":"Kino Wilga 312","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Garwolin","city_id":1656,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"14021":{"id":14021,"title":"ZAPOMNIANA WYSPA ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/zapomniana-wyspa-2026-10-09-12-40-8","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2013\/1790070476.jpg","date":"2026-10-18T14:20:00+02:00","availableTickets":312,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"sale":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-18 13:35:00","startAt":"2026-09-21 00:00:00"},"reservation":{"enabled":true,"endAt":"2026-10-18 13:20:00"},"products":[{"id":17,"name":"Normalny 2D","rawPrice":2200,"price":"22,00","allowSaleUsingPass":false,"available":312}],"customerPassAvailable":[],"customerHaveTicket":[]},"event":{"id":2013,"name":"ZAPOMNIANA WYSPA ","description":"<span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Podczas \u015bwi\u0119towania ostatniej wsp\u00f3lnej nocy, Jo i Raissa natrafiaj\u0105 na tajemniczy portal, kt\u00f3ry przenosi je na fantastyczn\u0105 wysp\u0119 Nakali, pe\u0142n\u0105 magicznych i mitycznych stworze\u0144, o kt\u00f3rych s\u0142ucha\u0142y w opowie\u015bciach swoich filipi\u0144skich rodzin.<\/span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Niekt\u00f3re z tych postaci stan\u0105 si\u0119 przyjaci\u00f3\u0142mi, inne wrogami. Jo i Raissa musz\u0105 stawi\u0107 czo\u0142a najgro\u017aniejszemu stworzeniu na wyspie.<\/span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; margin-block: 0px; margin-inline: 0px; padding-inline-start: 0px; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(36, 36, 36); font-family: Lato, &quot;Noto Sans Symbols&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Kiedy odkryj\u0105, \u017ce wspomnienia ca\u0142ej ich przyja\u017ani s\u0105 cen\u0105 za powr\u00f3t do domu, Jo i Raissa b\u0119d\u0105 \u015bciga\u0107 si\u0119, by znale\u017a\u0107 spos\u00f3b na opuszczenie wyspy, zanim zapomn\u0105 o sobie na zawsze.<\/span>","oryginal_title":" Forgotten Island","additional_title":null,"distributor":null,"sKSIdent":"2026D2D4666","movieType":"","director":"Joel Crawford\/ Januel Mercado","organizer":"","country":"USA","year":"2026","category":"","categoryId":null,"omomoCategory":"1","duration":0,"image":"\/uploads\/event\/2013\/1790070476.jpg","artists":[]},"location":{"id":26,"name":"Kino Wilga 312","institution_name":"","location_description":"","location_type":1,"location_type_name":"sala","city":"Garwolin","city_id":1656,"zip":"","addresse":""}},"14016":{"id":14016,"title":"LALKA  ","url":"\/kup-bilet\/lalka-2026-10-02-16-10-7","image":"\/uploads\/event\/2012\/1790070492.jpg","date":"2026-10-18T16:50:00+02:00","availableTickets":312,"additionalInfo":"","info":{"